{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB不少經典劇集陪伴港人成長，當年穿梭各大劇集的熟悉的童星，轉眼間已長大成人，踏入人生新階段。</p><p>其中以童星出身的黃可盈（Melanie），早前宣布以新女團「IdG Sundae」成員「Melanie可盈」的身份正式出道。</p><p>她日前在社交網分享短</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:21:31.634228+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:01:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T14:18:03.830774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:18:03.830774+00:00","content_hash":"cf4c45c14a22bd52485049071f102762ce87ad00cb662588e30263f5ff983d3e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}